---
description: Create distinct dishes from verified ingredient capabilities and service intent.
args:{ledger:KitchenLedger;requirements:{mandatory:string[];preferences:string[];unverifiedIngredientIds:string[];requiredControls:string[];}}
returns:Dish[]
---
Build concepts around flavor, texture, seasonality and service, not superficial garnish variation. Bind recipe lines to known ingredient IDs and approved procedures. Keep an alternative only if every ingredient and process in it satisfies each applicable restriction. Preserve chef review for culinary quality; do not manufacture safety assurances.
